    "### Step 0C: Global State Initialization (Stateful Pipeline)\n",
    "\n",
    "**What?**\n",
    "This cell instantiates the pipeline's memory core—a global Python class (usually referred to as `state`) that tracks all information: raw datasets, cleaned data, generated metadata, models, and the audit log of all transformations applied. It also enables automatic reloading of modules.\n",
