    "Instead of scattering dozens of disconnected variables across the execution memory, aggregating all data, configurations, and decisions into a single cohesive object maintains order. This eliminates variable shadowing errors, ensures smooth data transfer between disconnected steps, and makes the final export mechanism fully reliable.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs:**\n",
    "- Pipeline execution context.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs:**\n",
    "- `state`: A comprehensive global object holding data registries (`data_raw`, `data_cleaned`, `models`), configuration dictionaries, and historical tracking logs.\n"
