    "### Step 1A: Central Configuration Loader\n",
    "\n",
    "**What?**\n",
    "This step loads the \"engine of possibilities\" for the entire pipeline. It establishes a centralized configuration dictionary that defines all valid methods for data cleaning, encoding strategies, feature engineering algorithms, evaluation metrics, and supported Machine Learning models (classic and deep learning).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why?**\n",
    "By strictly separating the user interface code from the logical definitions, the pipeline becomes extensible. Modifying this central registry automatically updates the available options in drop-down menus across all subsequent notebook cells without rewriting their underlying source code.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs:**\n",
    "- Raw source code definitions (methods, metrics, algorithms).\n",
    "- The `state` object to host the configuration.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs:**\n",
    "- A populated `state.config` dictionary mapped to the UI.\n",
    "- An interactive summary panel displaying the number of registered methods per category.\n"
   ]
